[FEATURE_NAME] is now in [PRODUCT_NAME]

[FEATURE_SUMMARY] It replaces [FEATURE_REPLACES]. It is switched on
for everyone in [TEAM_NAME] with the [ROLE_NAME] role, so there is
nothing to turn on, and nothing you have already set up changes.

Three things it now makes possible:

- [FEATURE_USE_1]
- [FEATURE_USE_2]
- [FEATURE_USE_3]

Open your workspace:

[CTA_URL]

The settings, the limits, and the detail left out of this email are
in the [PRODUCT_NAME] documentation:

[SECONDARY_URL]

If something does not work the way this email describes, reply to
this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every
message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
